date-released: 2026-11-05
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Dark-adapted photosynthetic efficiency, seawater temperature and illuminance
  records, and symbiont qPCR data from a seven-day thermal stress experiment on
  Acropora cf. manni, Pavona decussata and Sclerophytum sp. at the University of
  Guam Marine Laboratory, March 2025, together with the R scripts used to
  analyse them.
keywords:
  - coral bleaching
  - Symbiodiniaceae
  - Endozoicomonas
  - PAM fluorometry
  - thermal stress
